{"unit_id":"KNGLOKIKO__dsh-plugin-approval-zh#card-zh","repo":"KNGLOKIKO/dsh-plugin-approval-zh","commit":"bb5c3c2c84dbc905405f49e93b5c52f023d8d897","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"approval-zh 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的中文审批面板插件。它在 conversation.composer 链槽中优先注册自定义面板，将等待审批、拒绝和允许一次等界面文案显示为中文，并用内置词表翻译常见授权原因。对未收录的英文原因，宿主端可选用 model-router 进行兜底翻译；命令明细从会话快照读取。适合希望用中文查看 DSH 权限确认内容的用户。兜底翻译依赖可解析的 model-router 库，预算默认 2500 毫秒。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:33-91","client.js:394-449","index.js:68-150"]}
{"unit_id":"KNGLOKIKO__dsh-plugin-approval-zh#card-en","repo":"KNGLOKIKO/dsh-plugin-approval-zh","commit":"bb5c3c2c84dbc905405f49e93b5c52f023d8d897","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"approval-zh localizes the DSH Web approval panel with Chinese labels and a dictionary for common authorization reasons. Unmatched reasons can use an optional model-router fallback. It helps users review DSH approval prompts in Chinese; fallback uses a 2500 ms budget.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:33-91","client.js:394-449","index.js:68-150"]}
