{"unit_id":"KNGLOKIKO__dsh-plugin-approval-zh#intent-2","repo":"KNGLOKIKO/dsh-plugin-approval-zh","commit":"bb5c3c2c84dbc905405f49e93b5c52f023d8d897","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 审批原因总是英文，有没有办法看中文？","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:78-91","index.js:137-150"]}
{"unit_id":"KNGLOKIKO__dsh-plugin-approval-zh#intent-3","repo":"KNGLOKIKO/dsh-plugin-approval-zh","commit":"bb5c3c2c84dbc905405f49e93b5c52f023d8d897","type":"intent","lang":"en","text":"I want to read DSH approval prompts and authorization reasons in Chinese.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:78-91","client.js:394-449"]}
{"unit_id":"KNGLOKIKO__dsh-plugin-approval-zh#feature-1","repo":"KNGLOKIKO/dsh-plugin-approval-zh","commit":"bb5c3c2c84dbc905405f49e93b5c52f023d8d897","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"approval-zh 的功能「中文审批面板」：在 Web 客户端接管 conversation.composer 中的审批卡片，以中文显示等待状态、原因和操作按钮；常见英文授权原因由本地词表转换，未命中的内容保留原文。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:123-136","client.js:314-367","client.js:422-449"]}
{"unit_id":"KNGLOKIKO__dsh-plugin-approval-zh#feature-2","repo":"KNGLOKIKO/dsh-plugin-approval-zh","commit":"bb5c3c2c84dbc905405f49e93b5c52f023d8d897","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"approval-zh 的功能「授权原因兜底翻译」：宿主收到不含中文的审批原因时，可调用 model-router 翻译后写回原因；使用缓存合并重复请求，默认最多等待 2500 毫秒，翻译失败时继续传递审批请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:68-135","index.js:137-150"]}
{"unit_id":"KNGLOKIKO__dsh-plugin-approval-zh#caveat-router-data","repo":"KNGLOKIKO/dsh-plugin-approval-zh","commit":"bb5c3c2c84dbc905405f49e93b5c52f023d8d897","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"approval-zh 使用 model-router 兜底时，会将未中文化的授权原因作为聊天提示内容传给路由库；具体外部服务取决于该库的配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:96-110","index.js:137-150"]}
